    "description": "<p>This is the reader-facing SGA working record for the Modern LaTeX Editions of Mathematics Manuscripts project. It contains modern LaTeX working editions, French source-repair workpasses, machine-assisted English translations, a bounded Spanish SGA 6 translation, source witnesses, build evidence, and audit material for SGA 5 and SGA 6.</p><p><strong>Open first:</strong> <code>00_SGA5_English_SourceChecked_WorkingTranslation_NotCritical_20260717.pdf</code>, the current 309-page source-aware SGA 5 English working translation. The record also directly exposes the corrected 381-page SGA 6 English reader, the 374-page French SGA 6 source-rescribe checkpoint at idx684, the French SGA 5 workpass, and the bounded Spanish SGA 6 Expose X tranche for idx532--537.</p><p><strong>SGA 5 Spanish withdrawal:</strong> the Spanish SGA 5 checkpoints in records 21428977 and 21429136 are not current release material. A terminology-ledger cross-check found that the attempted re-audit in record 21429136 replaced the edition's canonical Spanish category-theory forms <em>funtor/funtorial</em> with English-shaped forms. The mathematics in the bounded interval was not found defective, but the language regression makes that payload non-canonical. This version therefore removes both held Spanish SGA 5 checkpoint surfaces from the current file set. A newly rebuilt Spanish checkpoint will be added only after new canonical hashes and a fresh handoff are issued.</p><p><strong>SGA 6 English authority layers:</strong> source-PDF 001--525 uses an inherited English control that is partially source-synchronized but not globally source-checked; idx532--662 is source-checked against the directly checked French workpass available for that range; idx663--702 and terminal matter are scan-checked English draft layers pending later French reconciliation.</p><p><strong>Status:</strong> these are substantive machine-assisted, source-aware working editions and translations, not OCR-only output. None is an independently human-certified critical edition, complete SGA translation, whole-volume source-faithfulness certification, publication-grade proofread edition, or diagram-by-diagram certification. Known and unknown mathematical or diagram errors may remain. Corrections can be proposed through the <a href=\"https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts\">GitHub mirror</a>.</p>",
    "additional_descriptions": [
      {
        "description": "Reader-first SGA 5 and SGA 6 working surface. This version replaces the earlier Spanish SGA 5 checkpoint with a 296-page, 345-unit source-reconciled reader through Expose XV section 2, no. 1 and the complete proof of Proposition 1. SGA 6 French remains at public idx684 and SGA 6 English retains separated authority layers. Not a completed or critical edition, whole-volume source-faithfulness certification, or diagram-by-diagram certification.",
        "type": {
          "id": "notes",
          "title": {
            "de": "Anmerkungen",
            "en": "Notes"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
